  "item_short_desc": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Designed to withstand extreme cold weather conditions, Rothco&rsquo;s Insulated Gloves provide unparalleled warmth and protection from the elements. The high-denier nylon outer shell, combined with leather palms and fingers, ensures maximum durability and defense against harsh weather. An interior waterproof bladder and soft tricot lining enhance breathability, effectively wicking away perspiration to keep your hands dry.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
